<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT Carriage Services started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT Carriage Services started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Fran Bernstein said she initiated coverage of Carriage Services Inc with a near-term accumulate and a long-term buy rating, citing growth prospects for the company.</p>
